[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3541.19, "timestamp": "00:59:01", "text": "哦，当你把鼠标悬停在上面时，它们就会产生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3546.15, "timestamp": "00:59:06", "text": "那种效果。 悬停效果。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3548.789, "timestamp": "00:59:08", "text": "所以，还有很多。 是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3552.95, "timestamp": "00:59:12", "text": "向下滚动页面时就会显示这些内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3557.349, "timestamp": "00:59:17", "text": "我们也会有的。 不用担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3559.829, "timestamp": "00:59:19", "text": "嗯，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3563.19, "timestamp": "00:59:23", "text": "是这样做的。 他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3570.549, "timestamp": "00:59:30", "text": "M"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3573.19, "timestamp": "00:59:33", "text": "代表天气星球。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3590.87, "timestamp": "00:59:50", "text": "他们用这种方方正正的方式，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3595.99, "timestamp": "00:59:55", "text": "像一、二、三这样的动作来完成这项工作。"}]